                                        "sense_id": "a8665d58-529b-30fd-951b-35e33b017a36",
                                        "entry_id": "abe42644-ab9b-38ab-aafa-74fc4de3bf56",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A thick cloud that forms near the ground; the obscurity of such a cloud."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "09db3ed6-f7c7-4afb-a85b-cf3476fef152",
                                                "sense_id": "a8665d58-529b-30fd-951b-35e33b017a36",
                                                "text": "a bank of fog"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "551722bc-faf2-4673-95ca-8a9828261d10",
                                                "sense_id": "a8665d58-529b-30fd-951b-35e33b017a36",
                                                "text": "Thus the red damask curtains which now shut out the fog-laden, drizzling atmosphere of the Marylebone Road, had cost a mere song, and yet they might have been warranted to last another thirty years. A great bargain also had been the excellent Axminster carpet which covered the floor;[…]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "90f14a3a-dfc3-499d-9879-ee5fa19ebc21",
                                                "sense_id": "a8665d58-529b-30fd-951b-35e33b017a36",
                                                "text": "Wallis and Curtiz eventually agreed to shoot Howard Koch’s preferred ending, with distraught Ilse^([sic]), still in love with Rick, going off with Laszlo to America, and Rick and Louis going off together into the fog. (In Morocco? Fog? Never mind.)"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e08db09d-881b-3ea3-bbe7-b46562599eb5",
                                        "entry_id": "abe42644-ab9b-38ab-aafa-74fc4de3bf56",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A mist or film clouding a surface."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b006f8ca-a030-3a9d-9412-8b840fa97ee5",
                                        "entry_id": "abe42644-ab9b-38ab-aafa-74fc4de3bf56",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A state of mind characterized by lethargy and confusion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b8786e8-751a-4fea-a154-84ccfa3c162c",
                                                "sense_id": "b006f8ca-a030-3a9d-9412-8b840fa97ee5",
                                                "text": "He did so many drugs, he was still in a fog three months after going through detox."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "854a6f39-08df-4db8-a61b-645b5931cc33",
                                                "sense_id": "b006f8ca-a030-3a9d-9412-8b840fa97ee5",
                                                "text": "I was on my way to the door, but all at once, through the fog in my head, I began to sight one reef that I hadn't paid any attention to afore."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5ebc3986-fe93-3dcb-8618-ecb9ae7e5411",
                                        "entry_id": "abe42644-ab9b-38ab-aafa-74fc4de3bf56",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A silver deposit or other blur on a negative or developed photographic image."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "faa040d2-ffe5-382b-8da5-b4e0d064f94b",
