                                                "sense_id": "659f3f4e-ba57-39d1-9ce4-b043a0520cf5",
                                                "text": "[…] and they generally leave a great deal of Fog to rot on the Ground, which, with the Help of his well turned Dung-hill, dress his Ground […]"
